      "updated": 1788710796259,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Lock Management\n\n- Acquire distributed lock.\n- Release distributed lock.\n- Renew lock lease.\n- Check lock ownership.\n- Check lock status.\n- Force unlock (admin operation). in cases of deadlock\n- Support lock expiration. TTL for locks to recover deadlock",
      "fontSize": 26.39999999999999,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Lock Management\n\n- Acquire distributed lock.\n- Release distributed lock.\n- Renew lock lease.\n- Check lock ownership.\n- Check lock status.\n- Force unlock (admin operation). in cases of deadlock\n- Support lock expiration. TTL for locks to recover deadlock",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "HxkWbxEh3F783ekjrcbGX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 919.5,
      "y": 70,
      "width": 236.6059112548828,
      "height": 270.75965382345214,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
