      "text": "Exclusive Lock     : Only one holder at a time.\nShared Lock        : Many holders allowed simultaneously.\nRead/Write Lock  : same as exclusive but named by intent.\nReentrant Lokc    : The same owner can acquire the same lock again without deadlocking.\nFair Lock            : Locks are granted in arrival order.\nLease Based Lock : TTL based\n  ",
      "fontSize": 46.66666666666616,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Exclusive Lock     : Only one holder at a time.\nShared Lock        : Many holders allowed simultaneously.\nRead/Write Lock  : same as exclusive but named by intent.\nReentrant Lokc    : The same owner can acquire the same lock again without deadlocking.\nFair Lock            : Locks are granted in arrival order.\nLease Based Lock : TTL based\n  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
